1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,020
Big friend quiz!

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:05,140
Big friends are pairs that make ten, like four and six.

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:06,800
Stuck on the ones rod?

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:10,500
A big friend helps us, whether we add or take away!

5
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:13,160
Lightning round, one minute on the clock!

6
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:13,980
Go!

7
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,680
Seventy-six take away seven is stuck!

8
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,360
Friend, now, no time to waste!

9
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,620
Seven's friend is three!

10
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:26,740
Add three, then take away ten, go!

11
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:30,060
Seventy-six take away seven is sixty-nine!

12
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:30,720
Next!

13
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,300
Seventy-seven plus three is stuck!

14
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:34,740
Friend, fast!

15
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,040
Three's friend is seven!

16
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:42,220
Take away seven, then add ten, go!

17
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,880
Seventy-seven plus three is eighty!

18
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:45,700
Next!

19
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:48,140
Thirty-four plus six is stuck!

20
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:50,340
Friend, quick, clock's ticking!

21
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:54,720
Six's friend is four!

22
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:57,860
Take away four, then add ten, go!

23
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:00,380
Thirty-four plus six is forty!

24
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:01,400
One left!

25
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:02,600
Last one!

26
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:05,020
Eighty-three take away five is stuck!

27
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,820
Friend, last call!

28
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:11,140
Five's friend is five!

29
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:14,240
Add five, then take away ten, go!

30
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:17,320
Eighty-three take away five is seventy-eight!

31
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:18,200
Time!

32
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:20,420
Lightning round, perfect score!

33
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,980
Four numbers, zero mistakes, one minute flat.

34
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:29,420
